{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "175", "x": 0.895551985636664, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03819126296697169, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Man): Like what?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12334338960510077, "w": 0.29801666502114116, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Sandra): They're coming next month, right? Well, check and see if it's", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15360198182160828, "w": 0.8264574716751747, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "the same weekend as the Roots Music Festival in Blakewell Gardens.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.173922722295561, "w": 0.7087033587072341, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Man): Rouble Ots.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.20418138995485352, "w": 0.30607953496321355, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Sandra): Yeah, check it out online. It's always a familyfriendly event", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23443998217136106, "w": 0.8261902916455593, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "and there's no entry charge.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.25476072264531374, "w": 0.2949930759772448, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Man): That sounds perfect.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.28520475322740463, "w": 0.3984332700446794, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Sandra): And if you're In Blakewell Gardens, climb Telegraph Hill.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.31546334544391214, "w": 0.8266393509432245, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "You'll be able to look right down on the port. Everyone's always really impressed", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.33578406705716857, "w": 0.8260115906510775, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "because it's so huge.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3561048075311213, "w": 0.22182234927114497, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Man): Oh, yeah. I've been meaning to do that for ages. I've heard the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3863633997476288, "w": 0.8261110398562682, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "views are amazing.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4068324984583267, "w": 0.20126196940388813, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Sandra): Yeah, it's really worth the effort.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4370911283962267, "w": 0.5496124659271132, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Man): Well, that's given me loads of ideas. Thanks so much for.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.46737446584622133, "w": 0.7550649377678657, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}], "source": "pdf text layer"}